<title>GERMANY: Merck unit takes over MBC Taiwan from Balzers.</title>
<headline>Merck unit takes over MBC Taiwan from Balzers.</headline>
<dateline>DARMSTADT, Germany 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merck AG, the financial holding unit of pharmaceuticals and drugs group Merck KGaA, has taken over MBC Taiwan, Merck said on Monday.</p>
<p>Merck, which acquired Switzerland's Balzers und Leybold's 50 percent stake in the firm, did not indicate what price it paid for the company which it now intends to name Merck Display Technologies Ltd.</p>
<p>The company said the takeover would help improve its position in the fast-growing LCD-industry market.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
